  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating climate change through avoiding deforestation and land tenure Q&apos;eqchi&apos;s indigenous communities in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmers in Alta Verapaz have limited income opportunities because of lack of land ownership and limited knowledge about the benefits of crop diversification. Sa Qa Chol Nimla Kalebaal (SANK) works with farmers in the municipalities of Chisec and Raxuh to secure land ownership and to provide technical assistance to develop skills in crop diversification. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Guatemala. SANKs activities bolster efforts to counteract environmental degradation and protect the natural resources that communities depend on</narrative>
  </description>
